<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore bunker final report and prices - July 29.</title>
<headline>Singapore bunker final report and prices - July 29.</headline>
<text>
<p>(DELIVERED U.S.$/TONNE)  380 CST  180 CST    MDO    GAS OIL</p>
<p> SINGAPORE CARGO	   96/98     98/100    UNQ    166/170</p>
<p> SINGAPORE BUNKER	 102/104   104/106  170/173  178/183</p>
<p>--------</p>
<p>COMMENTS - The Singapore bunker market firmed on Tuesday amid month-end berth congestion, traders said. But room for further gains was limited as most traders did not see healthy enquiries.</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom (65-870-3571)</p>
